# Off-LAN sources admitted to /llm and /llm/rerank.
#
# Copy to a sibling *.conf (the real files are gitignored — this repo is
# public and these addresses name third-party production infrastructure)
# and `docker-compose restart api-gateway` to apply.
#
# Every entry here is a public-internet host granted access to an endpoint
# that has no authentication of its own. Add one only with a comment saying
# what it is and who owns it, and remove it when that stops being true.
#
# Format is the body of an nginx `geo` block: <address|CIDR> 1;

# ListingsAISearch backend (ai.farmworth.com, AWS us-east-2). Calls
# server-to-server as pydantic-ai, so Cloudflare is not in this hop and its
# published ranges are irrelevant here. Valid only while that egress address
# is stable; if it is not an Elastic IP this breaks silently on any restart.
# 203.0.113.10/32 1;
